\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -9 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -8\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14052721/state.json" "file_sha256" "46ea079729a5544ab3430644feb74dedfb6a81f2354bbf2561fc13dc58abe0aa"} {"question" "q-316985" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14052721/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "ba9737e7eae048ec45c4a9960d0262eb7db37b4e9e9c5d74a8d439d7acc31b68"} {"question" "q-316985" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14052721/state.json" "file_sha256" "46ea079729a5544ab3430644feb74dedfb6a81f2354bbf2561fc13dc58abe0aa"} {"question" "q-316985" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "4"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14052721/state.json" "file_sha256" "46ea079729a5544ab3430644feb74dedfb6a81f2354bbf2561fc13dc58abe0aa"} {"question" "q-316985" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14052721/state.json" "file_sha256" "46ea079729a5544ab3430644feb74dedfb6a81f2354bbf2561fc13dc58abe0aa"} {"question" "q-316985